fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><br/><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Star1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Star1_fd1ea6.png\" width=\"10\"/></span></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group pi-horizontal-group-no-labels\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Notable Loot</caption>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Composite%20Hornbow\"><img alt=\"Composite Hornbow\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Composite_Hornbow_834b9c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot2\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Focus Cape\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Focus_Cape_0990d1.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot3\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Wand of Starstorm\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wand_of_Starstorm_b1b94d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot4\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Shockwave%20Amulet\"><img alt=\"Shockwave Amulet\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Shockwave_Amulet_45637c.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"bestloot5\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Hibiscus Dress\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Hibiscus_Dress_bf0141.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Maps and Pictures</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Wyrm Hill Darashia\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"103\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Wyrm_Hill_Darashia_6a7c68.jpg\" width=\"125\"/></span> </div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">8.20<br/>July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Hunting Places <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>These two hills can be found north of <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, west and southwest of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia%20Dragon%20Lair\">Darashia Dragon Lair</a> and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Pyramid\">Dark Pyramid</a> (see map). Both hills are small areas containing 2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyrm\">Wyrms</a> each, and the lack of running space makes this a rather frustrating hunting place for shooters. You need to cast <a href=\"#/wiki/Levitate\">Levitate</a> spell or use a stack of elevated items such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Parcel\">Parcels</a> to reach the last floor of these hills. Since Summer Update 2020, a <a href=\"#/wiki/Werehyaena\">Werehyaena</a> and a <a href=\"#/wiki/Werehyaena%20Shaman\">Werehyaena Shaman</a> spawn at the top of each hill, during <a href=\"#/wiki/Night\">night</a>, instead of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyrm\">Wyrms</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Hills and surrounding areas</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">Exp</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">HP</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\" style=\"text-align: center;\">Max. Damage</th><th style=\"font-size: small;\">Loot</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\"><img alt=\"Deer\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Deer_8cd0d3.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Deer\">Deer</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">0</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">25</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\">1 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Physical%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Physical Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Physical_Damage_Icon_356411.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span></span></td><td style=\"font-size: s